            <div type="edition" xml:lang="tam-Latn" rendition="class:tamil maturity:83215">
    
    <p>
        <lb n="1"/><hi rend="grantha">svasti śrī</hi><gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="4"/> <hi rend="grantha">sanaM śāśva</hi>taM <hi rend="grantha">para</hi>M kō-māṟa-paṉmar-āṉa tiripuvaṉa-cakkaravattikaḷ cōṇāṭu koṇṭu muṭi koṇṭa cōḻa-purattu vi<hi rend="grantha">jai</hi>yāpi<hi rend="grantha">ṣe</hi>kam paṇṇiyaruḷiya <hi rend="grantha">sunda</hi>ra <hi rend="grantha">pā</hi>ṇṭiya <hi rend="grantha">de</hi>vaṟku yāṇṭu 20 vatu Etirāmāṇṭu teṉpaṟappu-nāṭṭu tiruvātavūr kuḷam <hi rend="grantha"><unclear>su</unclear></hi>ṉakku
        
        <lb n="2"/>nīrpāñcu nelviḷaiyum <supplied reason="lost">kaṇṭa</supplied><hi rend="grantha">bhū</hi>miyilē Ivar <supplied reason="lost">tēmāṟṟacati</supplied>rukka mūṉṟum taṭika <g ref="sym:tam-nilam"/> <g ref="sym:tam-ma" type="ideogram">@</g> </p>
                <p>
        Innilam oru māvum koṇṭu Amutu-paṭi cāttu-p-paṭi tirumēṟ-pūccu tiruviḷakku Aṅku vanta tiruppēṟkum tirukkai vaḻakkattukkum aṟṟaikku Aḻiya vēṇṭuvaṉa Ellāttukkum maṟṟai nam nimantaṅkaḷukkum <hi rend="grantha">candrā</hi>tittavarai celvatāka kallilum cempilum <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="4"/>
        
        <lb n="3" break="no"/>ra<hi rend="grantha">m u</hi>ṭaiyāṉ periya mutaliyāṉa <hi rend="grantha">de</hi>vē<hi rend="grantha">ndra</hi>va<hi rend="grantha">llabhācāyaM lekhya</hi> vayaT <hi rend="grantha">jagatra</hi>ya ni<hi rend="grantha">mmā</hi>Mṇa <hi rend="grantha">trā</hi>ṇa <hi rend="grantha">saṃhāra-kāra</hi>ṇaM <hi rend="grantha">śrīma</hi>tu <hi rend="grantha">vādapūrīśasaM</hi> <hi rend="grantha">śāsa</hi>ṉam <hi rend="grantha">śāśva</hi>taM <hi rend="grantha">vara</hi>M nam tācikaḷil kuḻaiñcāḷ Aracaṉ-āṉa Ālāla cuntara naṅkaikku tāṉimakkuc ceyta-paṭi nammuṭaiya taṇṭīcaṉ ceyta-paṭi ceytāṉ tāṉ ceyta-paṭi yāvaṉa nammuṭaiya tirunīṟṟu-t toṇṭa
        
        <lb n="4" break="no"/>ṉ teṉṉakaṅka tēvaṉukkuc colla <unclear>nāyaṉār</unclear> <hi rend="grantha">candra</hi>ce<hi rend="grantha">kha</hi>ram-āṉ <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="3"/> muṉaiyataraiyaṉ <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="7"/> vītiyākkum paṭi ceyvittamaiyālum nam vītiyiṟ kiṭanta <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="3"/> ṭantu nam vīti varampum ceytamaiyālum nam piḷḷai <hi rend="grantha">kṣetrapāla</hi>ṉ paṇṇuvittamaiyālum namakkum palavūrkaḷukkuñ colli tirunīṟṟu-t toṇṭaṉu<supplied reason="lost">kkum</supplied> colli vīra-pāṇṭiya nallūrkkum cēmam
        
        <lb n="5"/>ceyvittamaiyālum namakku <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="4"/> y-eṟintu vīṭṭai kaliyāmalum mārkaḻi ātiraiyil namakku nam vātavūraṉ kō <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="4"/> vai vātavūraṉ kēṭpitta nāḷ mutal nammai kēṭpippāṉa <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="2"/> y-irukka atuvum namakku ceyvittamaiyālum Ivaḷ Ippaṭi ceytapaṭiyāl nammuṭaiya <hi rend="grantha">dā<unclear>sar</unclear></hi> namakkuc ceyya kaṭava urimaikaḷil I
        
        <lb n="6" break="no"/><gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="2"/> ṭākavum kuṭuttōm Ippaṭi kallilum cempilum veṭṭik koḷ <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="2"/> ḷākavum kuṭuttōm nam kōvaṇavarum Ippaṭikku taṅkaḷ cattimukamum <unclear>kuṭukka</unclear> Ippaṭi ciṟappāka kuṭutta Immuṟai Ivaṉukkum Ivaḷ vaṟkattārkkum Ivaḷ va<hi rend="grantha">ṃśa</hi>ttāṟkkum kuṭuttōm Ippaṭikku tiruvāymoḻintaruḷa tirumantiravōlai Eḻuttu <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="2"/> vār āyira nāṟpatteṇṇāyira-paṭṭaṉ Eḻuttu Ippaṭikku <gap reason="lost" unit="character" quantity="5"/>
    </p>
    
